{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45608","headline":"古镜词上刘侍郎 · 贯休","name":"古镜词上刘侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至宝不自宝，照古还照今。\n仙人手胼胝，寥泬秋沈沈。\n不是十二面，不是百炼金。\n若非八彩眉，不可辄照临。\n即归玉案头，爲君整冠簪。\n即居吾君手，照出天下心。\n恭闻太宗朝，此镜当宸襟。\n六合悬清光，万里无尘侵。\n此镜今又出，天地还得一。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}